SUMMARY:5th Annual Monarch Meet Up (Whiteville)
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate monarchs\, pollinators\, and the Whiteville community with the NCWF Southeastern Swamp Stewards Chapter at Penn’s Grill. Buy native plants from Shelton’s Herb Farm\, enjoy activities for all ages with Ever Art Co\, and get a free milkweed plant while supplies last! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/5th-annual-monarch-meet-up-whiteville/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/SSSmonarchmeetup.jpg
END:VEVENT
