SUMMARY:Brumley Oasis Maintenance Workday (Chapel Hill)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Tri-County Conservationists Chapter for an oasis maintenance workday! The chapter has worked hard all winter to plant and fence 8 native plant oases in Brumley Preserve South in Chapel Hill. Now comes the imporant work of stewarding and maintaining the 500 native saplings planted in these oases. Join us to inspect and mend fences\, water plants as needed\, and if we have time\, remove small invasives.  \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/brumley-oasis-maintenance-workday-chapel-hill-2/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
